{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "data-states",
  "title": "Data states",
  "group": "Foundations",
  "order": 3,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Every view that shows data is designed in four states: loading, empty, error and loaded. Each state reuses an existing component (`skel`, `empty`, `alert`) and keeps the same footprint, so the page does not jump between them.",
    "id": "Setiap tampilan yang menampilkan data dirancang dalam empat status: memuat, kosong, galat, dan termuat. Setiap status memakai ulang komponen yang sudah ada (`skel`, `empty`, `alert`) dan menjaga ukuran yang sama, sehingga halaman tidak melompat di antaranya."
  },
  "titleId": "Data states",
  "react": true,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "All four states",
        "desc": "The same assignment list in each state. Switch between them: the box keeps its place and the controls above it stay usable.",
        "html": "<div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 16px; max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"State\" data-lds-segmented style=\"max-width: 360px;\">\n    <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.closest('.stack').querySelectorAll('[data-state]').forEach(p => p.hidden = p.dataset.state !== 'loading')\">Loading</button>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.closest('.stack').querySelectorAll('[data-state]').forEach(p => p.hidden = p.dataset.state !== 'empty')\">Empty</button>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.closest('.stack').querySelectorAll('[data-state]').forEach(p => p.hidden = p.dataset.state !== 'error')\">Error</button>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.closest('.stack').querySelectorAll('[data-state]').forEach(p => p.hidden = p.dataset.state !== 'loaded')\">Loaded</button>\n  </div>\n  <div data-state=\"loading\"><div class=\"list\" role=\"status\" aria-busy=\"true\" aria-label=\"Loading assignments\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 62%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 37%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 48%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 23%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 55%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 30%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n</div></div>\n  <div data-state=\"empty\" hidden><div class=\"list list--fill\">\n  <div class=\"empty\">\n    <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">event_available</span></div>\n    <div class=\"empty__title\">Nothing due this week</div>\n    <div class=\"empty__body\">New assignments appear here as soon as your lecturers post them.</div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\">Open full calendar</button>\n  </div>\n</div></div>\n  <div data-state=\"error\" hidden><div class=\"alert alert--danger\" role=\"alert\">\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">error</span>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"alert__title\">Assignments did not load</div>\n    <div class=\"alert__body\">The course service did not answer in time. Your work is safe.</div>\n    <div class=\"alert__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span>Try again</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div>\n  <div data-state=\"loaded\" hidden><div class=\"list\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Lab report 3</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Computer Networks · due tomorrow</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--warning\">Tomorrow</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Problem set 7</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Linear Algebra · due Thursday</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Thu</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Reading: chapter 9</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Operating Systems · due Friday</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Fri</span></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<!-- loading -->\n<div class=\"list\" role=\"status\" aria-busy=\"true\" aria-label=\"Loading assignments\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 62%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 37%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 48%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 23%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 55%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 30%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- empty -->\n<div class=\"list list--fill\">\n  <div class=\"empty\">\n    <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">event_available</span></div>\n    <div class=\"empty__title\">Nothing due this week</div>\n    <div class=\"empty__body\">New assignments appear here as soon as your lecturers post them.</div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\">Open full calendar</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- error -->\n<div class=\"alert alert--danger\" role=\"alert\">\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">error</span>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"alert__title\">Assignments did not load</div>\n    <div class=\"alert__body\">The course service did not answer in time. Your work is safe.</div>\n    <div class=\"alert__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span>Try again</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- loaded -->\n<div class=\"list\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Lab report 3</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Computer Networks · due tomorrow</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--warning\">Tomorrow</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Problem set 7</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Linear Algebra · due Thursday</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Thu</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Reading: chapter 9</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Operating Systems · due Friday</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Fri</span></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Empty because of a filter",
        "desc": "When filters cause the empty result, say so and offer to clear them, not to create something.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list list--fill\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"empty\">\n    <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">filter_list</span></div>\n    <div class=\"empty__title\">No courses match these filters</div>\n    <div class=\"empty__body\">Nothing is open in semester 3 with fewer than 3 credits.</div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\">Clear filters</button>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Error that keeps the old data",
        "desc": "A refresh failed but the last loaded rows are still useful: keep them and put the alert above them.",
        "html": "<div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 12px; max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"alert alert--warning\" role=\"status\">\n    <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">sync_problem</span>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"alert__title\">Showing results from 09:40</div>\n      <div class=\"alert__body\">We could not refresh your grades. Check your connection and try again.</div>\n      <div class=\"alert__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span>Refresh</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"list\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Lab report 3</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Computer Networks · due tomorrow</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--warning\">Tomorrow</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Problem set 7</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Linear Algebra · due Thursday</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Thu</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Reading: chapter 9</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Operating Systems · due Friday</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Fri</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Keempat status",
        "desc": "Daftar permohonan yang sama di setiap status. Beralih di antaranya: kotak tetap di tempat dan kontrol di atasnya tetap bisa dipakai.",
        "html": "<div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 16px; max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Status\" data-lds-segmented style=\"max-width: 360px;\">\n    <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.closest('.stack').querySelectorAll('[data-state]').forEach(p => p.hidden = p.dataset.state !== 'loading')\">Memuat</button>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.closest('.stack').querySelectorAll('[data-state]').forEach(p => p.hidden = p.dataset.state !== 'empty')\">Kosong</button>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.closest('.stack').querySelectorAll('[data-state]').forEach(p => p.hidden = p.dataset.state !== 'error')\">Galat</button>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.closest('.stack').querySelectorAll('[data-state]').forEach(p => p.hidden = p.dataset.state !== 'loaded')\">Termuat</button>\n  </div>\n  <div data-state=\"loading\"><div class=\"list\" role=\"status\" aria-busy=\"true\" aria-label=\"Memuat permohonan\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 62%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 37%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 48%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 23%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 55%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 30%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n</div></div>\n  <div data-state=\"empty\" hidden><div class=\"list list--fill\">\n  <div class=\"empty\">\n    <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">event_available</span></div>\n    <div class=\"empty__title\">Tidak ada berkas jatuh tempo minggu ini</div>\n    <div class=\"empty__body\">Permohonan baru muncul di sini begitu warga mengirimkannya.</div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\">Buka kalender lengkap</button>\n  </div>\n</div></div>\n  <div data-state=\"error\" hidden><div class=\"alert alert--danger\" role=\"alert\">\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">error</span>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"alert__title\">Permohonan gagal dimuat</div>\n    <div class=\"alert__body\">Layanan perizinan tidak menjawab tepat waktu. Data Anda tetap aman.</div>\n    <div class=\"alert__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span>Coba lagi</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div>\n  <div data-state=\"loaded\" hidden><div class=\"list\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Izin usaha mikro</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">UMKM Sukarame · jatuh tempo besok</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--warning\">Besok</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Izin keramaian</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Kelurahan Kedaton · jatuh tempo Kamis</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Kam</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Surat keterangan domisili</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Kecamatan Way Halim · jatuh tempo Jumat</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Jum</span></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<!-- loading -->\n<div class=\"list\" role=\"status\" aria-busy=\"true\" aria-label=\"Memuat permohonan\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 62%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 37%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 48%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 23%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 14px; width: 55%;\"></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"display: block; height: 11px; width: 30%; margin-top: 8px;\"></span></span><span class=\"skel\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- empty -->\n<div class=\"list list--fill\">\n  <div class=\"empty\">\n    <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">event_available</span></div>\n    <div class=\"empty__title\">Tidak ada berkas jatuh tempo minggu ini</div>\n    <div class=\"empty__body\">Permohonan baru muncul di sini begitu warga mengirimkannya.</div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\">Buka kalender lengkap</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- error -->\n<div class=\"alert alert--danger\" role=\"alert\">\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">error</span>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"alert__title\">Permohonan gagal dimuat</div>\n    <div class=\"alert__body\">Layanan perizinan tidak menjawab tepat waktu. Data Anda tetap aman.</div>\n    <div class=\"alert__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span>Coba lagi</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- loaded -->\n<div class=\"list\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Izin usaha mikro</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">UMKM Sukarame · jatuh tempo besok</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--warning\">Besok</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Izin keramaian</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Kelurahan Kedaton · jatuh tempo Kamis</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Kam</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Surat keterangan domisili</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Kecamatan Way Halim · jatuh tempo Jumat</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Jum</span></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Kosong karena filter",
        "desc": "Jika filter yang menyebabkan hasil kosong, katakan begitu dan tawarkan untuk menghapusnya, bukan membuat sesuatu.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list list--fill\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"empty\">\n    <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">filter_list</span></div>\n    <div class=\"empty__title\">Tidak ada layanan yang cocok dengan filter ini</div>\n    <div class=\"empty__body\">Tidak ada layanan yang buka di Kecamatan Rajabasa dengan waktu proses kurang dari 3 hari.</div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\">Hapus filter</button>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Galat yang mempertahankan data lama",
        "desc": "Penyegaran gagal tetapi baris yang terakhir dimuat masih berguna: pertahankan dan taruh alert di atasnya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 12px; max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"alert alert--warning\" role=\"status\">\n    <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">sync_problem</span>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"alert__title\">Menampilkan data pukul 09.40</div>\n      <div class=\"alert__body\">Daftar permohonan tidak bisa diperbarui. Periksa koneksi Anda lalu coba lagi.</div>\n      <div class=\"alert__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span>Perbarui</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"list\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Izin usaha mikro</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">UMKM Sukarame · jatuh tempo besok</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--warning\">Besok</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Izin keramaian</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Kelurahan Kedaton · jatuh tempo Kamis</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Kam</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Surat keterangan domisili</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Kecamatan Way Halim · jatuh tempo Jumat</span></span><span class=\"badge\">Jum</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "reactUsage": "import { Alert } from 'lampung-design-system/react';\n\nif (status === 'loading') return <div className=\"list\" role=\"status\" aria-busy=\"true\" aria-label=\"Loading assignments\">{/* .skel rows */}</div>;\nif (status === 'error') return <Alert tone=\"danger\" title=\"Assignments did not load\" actions={<button className=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" onClick={retry}>Try again</button>}>The course service did not answer in time.</Alert>;\nif (items.length === 0) return <div className=\"empty\">{/* icon, title, body, one action */}</div>;",
  "related": [
    "skeleton",
    "empty-state",
    "alert",
    "chart-states"
  ]
}
